// `Instruction.Conclude` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). The performer is the actor: the alias
// takes no performer (ADR 7, ruling 2026-10-05).
(
    name: "conclude",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"verb": Any},
    body: Conclude(verb: Param(verb)),
)
